read from the Senate's own motion text: amendments and minority motions, the adoption of a bill or draft resolution (final passage), motions to reject a bill, formal motions and trial votes, and the rest (elections, dismissals, consents). The Senate's page for one vote of term X says no named results exist (a technical fault); it is left out.","Government and opposition follow Party tracker's cabinets through each club's party. Clubs of independents have neither.","Three printed senators (five dates) could not be matched to a person and are left out; a senator is matched on family name, the printed initials and the dates of the mandate, never on a name alone.","Positions are per-term W-NOMINATE estimates (see the Positions view). Committees (with roles and dates) and the number of plenary speeches are from the Senate's own page on each senator; speeches are counted, not read, so there are no word counts. Questions are not on this page."],"vote_types":[],"half_year_rule":"half-years follow the roll call's calendar date"},"terms":[{"term":8,"label":"VIII","first_vote":"2011-11-17","last_vote":"2015-10-01","term_end":"2015-11-11","n_mps":106,"n_roll_calls":4543,"vote_types":false,"club_functions":false,"bilateral_groups":false,"rapporteurs":false,"speech":true,"speaking_minutes":false,"questions":false,"reply_times":false,"ideal_points":true,"office_flags":false,"constituency_41":false,"votes":true,"attendance":true,"committees":true,"bills":true},{"term":9,"label":"IX","first_vote":"2015-11-12","last_vote":"2019-10-18","term_end":"2019-11-11","n_mps":101,"n_roll_calls":3665,"vote_types":false,"club_functions":false,"bilateral_groups":false,"rapporteurs":false,"speech":true,"speaking_minutes":false,"questions":false,"reply_times":false,"ideal_points":true,"office_flags":false,"constituency_41":false,"votes":true,"attendance":true,"committees":true,"bills":true},{"term":10,"label":"X","first_vote":"2019-11-12","last_vote":"2023-09-07","term_end":"2023-11-12","n_mps":100